/*!
\page page_sthltracknode StHltTrackNode

\brief HLT track node grouping a global track, primary track, BTOF hit, and BEMC tower hit for one particle candidate.

\section overview Overview

`StHltTrackNode` groups the global track, primary track, BTOF hit, and BEMC tower hit that belong
to a single particle candidate in the HLT. It stores geometrical matching quantities between the
track extrapolation and each detector element. Because it inherits from
\ref StHltTriggerReasonCapable, it can itself be the trigger object recorded in an
\ref StHltTriggerReason entry. Back-links from \ref StHltBEmcTowerHit and \ref StHltBTofHit
point to their parent `StHltTrackNode`.

\section hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StHltTriggerReasonCapable
        └── StHltTrackNode
\endcode

\section datamembers Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `int` | `mGlobalTrackSN` | Serial number of associated global track |
| `int` | `mPrimaryTrackSN` | Serial number of associated primary track |
| `int` | `mTofHitSN` | Serial number of associated BTOF hit |
| `int` | `mEmcTowerSN` | Serial number of associated BEMC tower hit |
| `double` | `mBEmcMatchPhiDiff` | φ difference between track and BEMC tower (rad) |
| `double` | `mBEmcMatchZEdge` | z-edge distance for BEMC tower match (cm) |
| `float` | `mBTofProjChannel` | Projected BTOF channel |
| `float` | `mBTofCellLocalY` | Local y within matched BTOF cell (cm) |
| `float` | `mBTofCellLocalZ` | Local z within matched BTOF cell (cm) |
| `float` | `mBTofPathLength` | Path length to matched BTOF hit (cm) |
| `float` | `mBeta` | Particle velocity β = v/c |

\section keymethods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `StHltTrack* globalTrack() const` | Associated global track |
| `StHltTrack* primaryTrack() const` | Associated primary track |
| `StHltBTofHit* bTofHit() const` | Associated BTOF hit |
| `StHltBEmcTowerHit* bEmcTowerHit() const` | Associated BEMC tower hit |
| `double bEmcMatchPhiDiff() const` | φ difference for BEMC match (rad) |
| `double bEmcMatchZEdge() const` | z-edge distance for BEMC match (cm) |
| `float bTofPathLength() const` | Path length to BTOF hit (cm) |
| `float beta() const` | Particle velocity β |

\section example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StSPtrVecHltTrackNode& nodes = hlt->trackNode();
for (size_t i = 0; i < nodes.size(); ++i) {
    const StHltTrackNode* node = nodes[i];
    if (node->bTofHit())
        cout << "beta=" << node->beta() << endl;
}
\endcode

\see StHltEvent
\see StHltTrack
\see StHltBTofHit
\see StHltBEmcTowerHit
\see StHltTriggerReasonCapable
\see StHltTriggerReason
*/
